body:
I need to have a field that, when typed in, shows the main search field and starts searching.

This is what I have: 

``` javascript
    $('.search-trigger').on('input', function() {
        const $this = $(this);
        const val = $this.val();

        if (val) {
            const $searchInput = $('#algolia-mobile-search-input').find('input');
            $searchInput.val(val);
            $searchInput.focus();
            $searchInput.trigger('input');
        }
    });
```

The value is set on the main input, but the search isn't performed. Maybe I'm approaching this from a wrong angle, but I expected this to work.

Thanks!

